<title>SPAIN: Continente to pay 40 ptas total 1996 div.</title>
<headline>Continente to pay 40 ptas total 1996 div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish hypermarket chain Continente will pay a dividend of 40 pesetas per share against 1996 results, the firm said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>This compares with a dividend of 38 pesetas in 1995 and is subject to shareholder approval.</p>
<p>A spokeswoman for Continente was unable to provide more details.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
